From 2228cfe8dada6912c5f8966f967d12870d029c2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:21:20 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(agent): retain unresolved fallback at
 finalization boundaries (#48)

* fix(agent): preserve unresolved goals at finalization boundaries [daveey]

* fix(agent): preserve profile context in final-gate workers [daveey]

* fix(agent): bind held rechecks and gate verification interims [daveey]

* fix(agent): propagate owner acceptance across later holds [daveey]

* fix(agent): assess disposition before ordinary gate holds [daveey]

* fix(gateway): expose scoped successful Kanban consumer polls [daveey]

* [daveey] Preserve native canonical user provenance through hooks and replay

* [daveey] Preserve legacy scope uncertainty across durable compaction

* [daveey] Reuse tolerant metadata decoding for provenance replay

* [daveey] Keep held candidates private across gateway delivery channels

* Add scoped ongoing Kanban dispatcher health receipts

* [daveey] Reject suppressed and stale dispatcher ownership evidence

* [daveey] Keep buffered final candidates out of console previews

* [daveey] Bind process ownership to canonical scope and live return evidence

* [daveey] Bind gateway process ownership to live admitted return routes

* [daveey] Bind process receipts to actual admitted events

* [daveey] Preserve authenticated live steering in final-gate scope

* fix(agent): retain steering before compaction [daveey]

* [daveey] Preserve foreign-tail ceiling when persisting steering

* [daveey] Preserve native canonical text during rewind validation

* [daveey] Bind HTTP remediation readback to native direct execution

* fix: synchronize HTTP readback stub and prompt fixtures

---------

